   "opened": "2026-07-23",
   "last_comment_at": "2026-09-22",
   "last_comment_by": "naved001",
   "last_comment": "We have 10 Blades (servers) in our system. Each blade has 4 DFMs (\"drives\"). We can lose an entire blade and another DFM simultaneously without any data loss. We cannot adjust the level of redundancy. ``` pureuser@moc-pure-fb-01> pureblade list Name Status Raw Capacity Details CH1.FB1 healthy 600.00TB - CH1.FB2 healthy 600.00TB - CH1.FB3 healthy 600.00TB - CH1.FB4 healthy 600.00TB - CH1.FB5 health…",
   "summary": "Closed with the answer: 10 FlashBlade blades of 4 DFMs each, able to lose a whole blade plus one more DFM without data loss. The redundancy level cannot be changed.",
   "summary_reviewed": "2026-09-23"
